Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一望无际的白色沙滩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.04,0:01:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一片湛蓝的海水
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.37,0:01:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晴朗的太阳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.34,0:01:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一整年都可以享受海水浴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:24.31,0:01:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更棒的是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.58,0:01:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,三面环绕的群山\N最适合登山健行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各种花草争奇斗艳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.06,0:01:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终年积雪的大雪山\N随时都可以滑雪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.73,0:01:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 竟然还有这么棒的地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:41.96,0:01:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请大家务必来此一游
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.20,0:01:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白金饭店随时等候您的光临
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.77,0:01:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是像那样的观光景点\N可能很难订到房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.34,0:01:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会的\N我们饭店还有很多空房呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您意下如何呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.88,0:02:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,偶尔全家一起去旅行\N好像也蛮不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.89,0:02:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感谢您的预约
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.01,0:02:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦 老公\N你知不知道现在几点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老公
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.58,0:02:36.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么又开着电视睡觉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.55,0:02:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样睡觉很容易感冒的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.16,0:02:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.51,0:03:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种事情真好 可以完成更好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.41,0:03:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种梦想 那种梦想\N多得数不完
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:12.52,0:03:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有所有的梦想 都能实现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.52,0:03:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用不可思议的百宝袋来实现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.53,0:03:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好想自由自在的在天空飞翔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.53,0:03:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就用竹蜻蜓吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.61,0:03:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,AN…我最喜欢哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.61,0:03:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,AN…我最喜欢哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.27,0:04:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 静香也要去夏威夷玩呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好巧喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.47,0:04:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我表弟也约我\N去夏威夷玩三天耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说的话\N也许我们会碰到面呢 对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.35,0:04:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫你呢 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.72,0:04:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很遗憾 春假太短了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我也只能到瑞士\N去滑滑雪啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是辛苦你们了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,春假期间到处都是人挤人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管去哪里都很累耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得还是留在家里睡午觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是最舒服的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.67,0:04:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊\N大雄家每年都是那样过的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.31,0:04:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真是比我们还好命耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊是啊 你真幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见啰\N再见了 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.12,0:04:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会带礼物回来给你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.12,0:04:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法 谁叫我们要出国呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.13,0:05:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你回来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.13,0:05:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 功课呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的\N这个孩子在生什么闷气啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.28,0:05:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真是全世界最不幸的少年了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.15,0:05:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会去拜托爸爸妈妈说\N想全家去旅行吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:23.99,0:05:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有用的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.15,0:05:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都不晓得\N已经拜托过几少次了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.64,0:05:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有几天的假可以休了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.31,0:05:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看吧 说看看还是很有用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.18,0:05:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是现在到处都约满了耶\N不是吗 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.32,0:05:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你放心好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经都订好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要快点去告诉大家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老公 你是什么时候预订的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这样的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.76,0:06:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说那个地方\N可以同时滑雪跟游泳啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你少骗人了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是真的 我没有骗你啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.21,0:06:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在这个时候哪还订得到空房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别骗人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸真的都已经订好了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.85,0:06:26.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.41,0:06:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你说的地方在哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.98,0:06:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哎呀 我也真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都忘记问了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许是在国外也说不定喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道的话 就马上跟你说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜拜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.13,0:06:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个人都好羡慕我喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.73,0:06:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说的白金饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.07,0:06:47.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是在哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.30,0:06:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个我也不是很清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 你不清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你是怎么预约的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨天晚上我看电视的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.81,0:07:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 你跟电视预约的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.15,0:07:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老公 你是不是在做梦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.65,0:07:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.46,0:07:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你快点拿道具出来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.86,0:07:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要找我\N再去跟爸爸说清楚嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来不及了啦\N用道具会比较快啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.64,0:07:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这个人怎么每一次都这样呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.14,0:07:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动不动就说要什么道具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.14,0:07:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,借一下会怎么样\N你又不会有什么损失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的 你太任性了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.35,0:07:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我跟大家说\N那是我爸爸在做梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.39,0:07:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我哪说得出口啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.62,0:07:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是静香啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.86,0:07:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实 我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你昨天跟我们说的\N全都是骗人的对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.10,0:07:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是故意要跟我们炫耀的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.27,0:08:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有骗你们\N我们是真的要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你们什么时候出发\N要去哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.75,0:08:05.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.75,0:08:07.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是秘密 不可以说出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.65,0:08:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为全世界的人\N都会跟着跑去那里的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还真会吹牛呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们才不会被骗呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是因为这样子 懂了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.19,0:08:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.29,0:08:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个少年呢\N一直不断的烦恼着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.13,0:08:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他该怎么办才好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我该怎么办才好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦又不肯帮我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.67,0:08:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底有没有认真的在听老师上课啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.81,0:08:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.81,0:08:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少啰嗦啦\N你没看到我正在想事情吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.31,0:08:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你就到走廊去罚站\N慢慢的想吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.82,0:08:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了好了 安静
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要再笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是…老师…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.03,0:08:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 我离家出走算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.91,0:09:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是离家出走用的行李箱吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这怎么可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.92,0:09:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是爸爸的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.45,0:09:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一定是哆啦A梦\N帮我拿出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不在啊 跑去哪里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.36,0:09:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然嘴巴说不愿意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.73,0:09:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到头来还是拿道具给我用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.47,0:09:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦对我真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面装了什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开来看一看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.47,0:09:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是钥匙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.21,0:09:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.26,0:09:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这…是什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.99,0:10:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了 那是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是你拿出来的道具吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是啊 我什么都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.73,0:10:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来\N很像任意门之类的东西耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.37,0:10:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.14,0:10:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的要进去吗\N会不会有什么问题啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.68,0:10:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒喔 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点来 快一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的没有问题吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 快来呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.66,0:10:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 是大海耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是车子耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.45,0:10:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车子上没有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.02,0:10:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.15,0:11:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来好像是\N用白金做成的玩具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐上去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.83,0:11:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个方向盘只是装饰用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.19,0:11:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 它动了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.10,0:11:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它要带我们去哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:11.97,0:11:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然像个玩具\N不过还真精致耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 那是什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道那是饭店吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪 它停下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.05,0:11:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们稍微偷看一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦\N这个楼梯会发出怪声耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.06,0:11:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个饭店\N好像全都是用白金做成的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.73,0:11:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道说…这里是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.20,0:11:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白金饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.27,0:11:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人在吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是预约好房间的野比
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.41,0:11:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问有人在吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:55.58,0:11:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,门上锁了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.91,0:11:59.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 也许…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个行李箱的钥匙可以用喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的打开了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进去看一看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一片黑漆漆的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.76,0:12:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个人也没有吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.39,0:12:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 请问有没有人在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.27,0:12:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,野比先生\N欢迎光临
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.87,0:12:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们等候多时了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.74,0:12:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎光临白金饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.78,0:12:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我叫白金 是这家饭店的经理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.15,0:12:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白金制的娃娃会说话耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.88,0:12:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,金属娃娃会说话难道不行吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没这个意思…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.39,0:12:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我带你们去房间吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请把行李给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.66,0:12:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用了 我们两个没有行李
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那真是伤脑筋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,替客人拿行李是我的工作耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.53,0:12:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,专门用来搬运用的行李
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.80,0:12:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好奇怪的道具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.80,0:13:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在就热热闹闹\N送你们到房间去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请往这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.31,0:13:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.58,0:13:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请往这边\N欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前从二楼到四楼的房间\N都没有人住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问你们要哪一间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.60,0:13:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那…我们要最顶楼的那间好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.47,0:13:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我就带你们到四楼的特别房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.34,0:13:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是这一间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.97,0:13:34.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个房间很不错耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.98,0:13:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这间是本饭店等级最高的房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.35,0:13:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等级最高的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你带了多少钱来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.12,0:13:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,35块 你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 你们不用担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.62,0:13:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前是本饭店开幕期间\N全部免费
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.86,0:13:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请好好休息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.89,0:13:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 太好了\N我们真幸运耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有件事忘了告诉你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.70,0:14:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.97,0:14:03.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何房间你们都可以随意使用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.40,0:14:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是千万不可以去偷看地下室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.24,0:14:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.48,0:14:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了\N知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁会去看什么地下室嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是先来睡个午觉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.85,0:14:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难得来这个地方\N睡觉多可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.22,0:14:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去游泳吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.16,0:14:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要游啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.80,0:14:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我忘了 我根本就不会游泳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.00,0:14:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有轻轻松松\N就可以学会游泳的道具啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有那种东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.74,0:14:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托啦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.01,0:14:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己慢慢练习吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.65,0:14:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那两个人怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.65,0:14:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我总觉得跟我想像的不太一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.75,0:14:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再多观察他们一些时候吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.42,0:14:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游了那么久 肚子觉得好饿喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骗人 你根本就没有游到嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.06,0:15:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有什么办法\N谁叫你不给我道具嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么搞的 又上锁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.47,0:15:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次回来都要开门\N真的很麻烦耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.17,0:15:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们回来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海水浴场游泳的感觉如何啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.58,0:15:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们为什么老是要锁门呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是当然啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了防止可疑的人跑进来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:21.68,0:15:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你们这边的治安\N这么不好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.69,0:15:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是不是 没这回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:26.72,0:15:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们这么做是为了慎重起见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.69,0:15:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 请两位过去用餐吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 很贵吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.56,0:15:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是开幕期间 一切免费
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请上三楼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.20,0:15:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好\N太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.21,0:15:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还担心是玩具料理呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.94,0:15:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好吃耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.08,0:15:52.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.41,0:15:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是好奇怪喔 这么好的饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,居然都没有别人来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为才刚刚开幕\N没有什么宣传经费
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.92,0:16:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们只能瞒着电视公司\N在半夜打广告
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.99,0:16:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么晚哪有人会看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.53,0:16:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们想要拜托你们\N多带一些朋友过来玩啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.50,0:16:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这没问题 交给我们好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:12.40,0:16:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吧\N没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.47,0:16:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等你们吃完饭以后呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个可以到那个山上滑雪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:22.51,0:16:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好玩喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们的招待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们已经准备好\N上山的交通工具了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.05,0:16:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 服务真周到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.29,0:16:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.29,0:16:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的东西\N都做成玩具的样子耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.80,0:16:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问这要怎么操作啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好玩喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.15,0:17:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,希望你们在山上滑雪玩得愉快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.05,0:17:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.45,0:17:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,视野这么好\N坐起来又很舒服耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.03,0:17:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仔细看 所有的花草树木\N全部都是人造的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能够操作这些娃娃的电脑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.33,0:17:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就凭20世纪的科学技术\N也是制造不出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.27,0:17:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很好奇 这到底是谁做的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.57,0:17:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要过隧道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.05,0:17:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过了这个隧道 就是雪景耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然有雪 可是一点也不会冷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.36,0:17:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些做的 真的是太精巧了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 把不用练习就会滑雪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:52.10,0:17:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且也不会摔跤的道具\N拿出来借给我好不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.40,0:17:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄\N你的个性怎么老是不改啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.44,0:18:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里 我再跟你说一遍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要是什么\N都依赖我的道具的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.58,0:18:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后你一定会变成一个\N什么都不会的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.31,0:18:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你干嘛把事情说得那么严重啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.62,0:18:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不是高高兴兴的出来玩吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.89,0:18:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 就这么一次\N拜托你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.89,0:18:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的只有这一次而已喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊 我们来打勾勾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果下一次你再这么任性的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.90,0:18:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就回去21世纪\N不要再管你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.63,0:18:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我知道了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要看啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超级平衡雪橇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.81,0:18:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个是利用亚吉罗贝原理的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.34,0:18:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 怎么自己上去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.31,0:18:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 我还没有说完呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.35,0:18:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 等等我\N我还没有说完呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系 你不用说明了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.32,0:18:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你真是太任性了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.39,0:18:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要再管你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.06,0:18:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我是一个滑雪天才呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.44,0:19:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,速度越来越快了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.61,0:19:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是这未免也太快了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.01,0:19:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的…脸…快要撕裂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.72,0:19:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 迷路的大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.19,0:19:26.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.96,0:19:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会摔到谷底了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.73,0:19:36.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会撞到树 被压扁了…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.71,0:19:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.51,0:19:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去那里看看\N可能会有什么线索喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.14,0:19:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是一艘飞行船
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.68,0:19:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且也是白金制的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.31,0:19:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是白金饭店的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 有没有看到大雄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.51,0:20:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会有这么危险道具嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.69,0:20:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.76,0:20:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个哆啦A梦 真是太无情了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.36,0:20:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然没有来找我 都不管我啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己一个人回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.81,0:20:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我记得\N应该是在这个方向没错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.68,0:20:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.29,0:21:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,累死我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:03.19,0:21:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,飞行船
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:13.07,0:21:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带我回饭店啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.74,0:21:27.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不行了 我一定会死掉的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.49,0:21:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天国的大象来接我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 是大象
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是来接我的对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.36,0:21:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问一下\N你有没有看到哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他先回去了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对喔\N他刚才真的好生气的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.37,0:21:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果下一次你再这么任性的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.11,0:21:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就回去21世纪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后再也不要管你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.68,0:22:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他真的生气的走掉了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.85,0:22:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他一定是故意吓唬我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.55,0:22:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:23.90,0:22:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.97,0:22:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 都是我不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.78,0:22:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,门没上锁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:31.38,0:22:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.55,0:22:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太不负责任了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.05,0:22:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人在吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.65,0:22:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.19,0:22:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:41.89,0:22:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦 他也没有回房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.79,0:22:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有人在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:50.40,0:22:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里也没有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.00,0:22:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的都没人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:59.61,0:23:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太过分了 大家都把我丢下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:04.64,0:23:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 地下室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:07.98,0:23:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那只兔子还说不能偷看\N太狡猾了…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.92,0:23:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么啊 好可怕喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:19.39,0:23:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是一扇门耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.09,0:23:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你们是不是都在里面啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:27.53,0:23:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你终于来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.20,0:23:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是通往另一个世界的\N大迷宫入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:32.14,0:23:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一进去里面就无法活着回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:34.71,0:23:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你有心理准备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:36.38,0:23:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就进去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:56.73,0:24:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一开始我就觉得\N这家饭店怪怪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.23,0:24:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经受不了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:05.57,0:24:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他真的不在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是我不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:14.48,0:24:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要生这么大的气嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:16.52,0:24:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经在自我反省了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:21.72,0:24:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托啦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:23.39,0:24:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要这样嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:26.99,0:24:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:28.16,0:24:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算没有你 我也无所谓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.01,0:24:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是什么地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.01,0:24:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪\N为什么我的身体无法动弹呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.98,0:24:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们大家…到底在做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.75,0:24:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.99,0:24:55.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你最好安份一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:55.62,0:24:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么要把我绑起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.96,0:24:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:58.63,0:25:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在要把你送到\N尼吉林将军那里去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:02.56,0:25:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不管去哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:04.26,0:25:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们快点把绳子解开
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:06.33,0:25:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为你太胖了 进不了飞行船
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:09.20,0:25:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们只好用拖车来搬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:11.24,0:25:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安静一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:13.14,0:25:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟敢说我胖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:17.04,0:25:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 你们不要太过分了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:19.58,0:25:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把这只狸抓起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:22.08,0:25:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说谁是狸啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:24.12,0:25:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再这样下去 我真的要生气了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:29.82,0:25:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑的速度还真快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:32.06,0:25:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪 他们到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:37.80,0:25:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道…\N那里就是他们的藏身之处吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:43.30,0:25:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是宇宙火箭吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:44.91,0:25:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,设计的型式还蛮古老的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:51.11,0:25:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尼吉林将军 就是它
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:53.58,0:25:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它就是那只凶暴的狸王
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:55.88,0:25:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别慌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:57.32,0:25:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它只是一只机器狸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:06.13,0:26:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又有玩具跑出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:14.13,0:26:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我问你 你们到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:25.28,0:26:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:26.28,0:26:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要一把电脑停止\N他就无法动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:29.78,0:26:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不愧是尼吉林将军
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:31.65,0:26:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,报告将军 飞行船回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:35.52,0:26:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们把沙比欧\N和他的同伴抓回来了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:43.33,0:26:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到沙比欧的藏匿之处了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:45.47,0:26:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,报告将军 我们已经找到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:48.07,0:26:48.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:48.97,0:26:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 里头一个人都没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:52.04,0:26:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:53.84,0:26:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他应该是找到地方躲起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:14.89,0:27:16.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:16.66,0:27:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看样子 他一晚都没有回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:19.50,0:27:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦真的那么生气吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:26.07,0:27:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你快点回来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:28.41,0:27:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以后不会再跟你要道具了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:43.66,0:27:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不敢相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:45.96,0:27:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦竟然弃我而去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:50.60,0:27:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:51.93,0:27:53.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底有没有认真听课
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:53.80,0:27:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 说话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:55.67,0:27:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少啰嗦\N你没有看到我正在想事情吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:00.37,0:28:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你就到走廊上去罚站\N慢慢的想吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:09.95,0:28:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:11.52,0:28:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑不掉了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:12.82,0:28:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 终于等到你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:16.02,0:28:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说春假快要到啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:18.69,0:28:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说你要去很棒的地方玩啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:21.23,0:28:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好羡慕你喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:23.00,0:28:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么时候才要出发呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:25.23,0:28:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,预定要玩几天呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪个国家呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:28.23,0:28:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住哪一家饭店啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你全是骗我们的吧 老实招来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:34.64,0:28:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不要这样啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:36.24,0:28:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们这样随便怀疑别人\N是不对的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:39.18,0:28:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香\N你就真的这么相信大雄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:42.95,0:28:44.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:44.68,0:28:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有哆啦A梦在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:47.29,0:28:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管什么事他都办得到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 那我们来打个赌吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:51.42,0:28:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,输的人要倒立\N绕我们这个社区一圈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:53.99,0:28:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:55.46,0:28:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香…打赌不太好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:58.26,0:29:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有意思 一言为定啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:00.80,0:29:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们现在\N就去找哆啦A梦问个清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:03.37,0:29:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:04.24,0:29:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 先等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:05.54,0:29:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦他不在家…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:08.54,0:29:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又想骗我们了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:12.45,0:29:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:13.88,0:29:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他果然是在骗人没有错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:16.18,0:29:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香 这是我们打赌的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:18.02,0:29:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别忘了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:18.72,0:29:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:20.02,0:29:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以去问大雄的妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:21.79,0:29:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就知道是不是真的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:33.90,0:29:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我本来不想再用它的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:38.61,0:29:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得根本就没有用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:40.51,0:29:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你非要这样做\N才肯死心的话…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:42.98,0:29:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:43.91,0:29:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁着春假\N我就带你们到白金饭店去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:47.28,0:29:48.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:48.28,0:29:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个地方不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:49.65,0:29:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们几个先把书包拿回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:51.72,0:29:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下到河边的空地来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:53.79,0:29:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 你可别再溜走喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:55.72,0:29:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要偷溜喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:57.09,0:29:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:58.42,0:30:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你放心吧\N我绝对不会让你倒立走路的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:09.94,0:30:12.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在先跟你们说清楚喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:12.54,0:30:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下到了那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:13.77,0:30:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只看一下下就得回来 知道吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:16.58,0:30:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个行李箱是做什么用的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:26.42,0:30:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是任意门吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:27.89,0:30:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不大像喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:29.36,0:30:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:30.56,0:30:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面有什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:32.69,0:30:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:36.66,0:30:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好漂亮的大海
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:39.63,0:30:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样 我没有骗你们吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:42.07,0:30:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你说的饭店在哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:44.77,0:30:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就会有人来接我们了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:49.41,0:30:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:51.28,0:30:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好可爱喔\N好棒喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:54.41,0:30:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个是发条式的自动汽车
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:59.15,0:31:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐上去它就自己会发动\N带我们去吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:02.22,0:31:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊\N好好玩喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:04.72,0:31:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是不可思议的世界\N没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:09.06,0:31:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是白金饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:11.00,0:31:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是用铁皮做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:12.80,0:31:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样 我没有骗你们吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:16.40,0:31:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 我们回去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:18.17,0:31:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 先等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:19.81,0:31:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们那么难得来到这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:21.91,0:31:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你起码让我们\N看一下饭店里面啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:24.44,0:31:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们还想进去看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:26.71,0:31:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是现在或许没有人在喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:29.15,0:31:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 饭店里面会没有人在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:32.42,0:31:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 搞不好这只是个空壳喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:35.26,0:31:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才不是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:36.42,0:31:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 只能看一下下而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:48.50,0:31:50.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好特别喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:50.64,0:31:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好喜欢这样的饭店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:52.44,0:31:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害喔 这是真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:55.21,0:31:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:57.44,0:31:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么一个人都没有呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:59.68,0:32:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:00.85,0:32:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为这里…全部都是自助式的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:04.12,0:32:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一个房间都可以任意的使用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:07.02,0:32:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了 那我们去探险吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:09.42,0:32:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:11.29,0:32:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能看一下下\N我们就得回去啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:18.16,0:32:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好漂亮的雪景
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:20.93,0:32:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是饭店的大餐厅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:23.07,0:32:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 有了大发现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:25.87,0:32:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一按下菜单按钮\N料理就自动跑出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:33.88,0:32:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们吃饱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:35.98,0:32:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 差不多也该回去了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:38.82,0:32:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:40.19,0:32:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们两个去游一下泳好不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:42.19,0:32:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好哇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:46.86,0:32:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:49.03,0:32:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然没有带泳衣来这
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:50.56,0:32:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是这么漂亮的大海\N还是忍不住要下水
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:56.17,0:32:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不是说好了\N只来一下就回去的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:59.27,0:33:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 等我啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:01.94,0:33:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好舒服喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:04.44,0:33:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:05.45,0:33:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好羡慕胖虎跟小夫喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:08.75,0:33:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香 你也可以下去游啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:10.78,0:33:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会介意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:12.29,0:33:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是我介意啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:14.12,0:33:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然是这样…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:16.82,0:33:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们两个才应该要节制一点呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:19.29,0:33:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你追不到我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:20.43,0:33:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好无聊喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:33.31,0:33:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 该回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:36.51,0:33:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:38.11,0:33:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,游得累死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:39.51,0:33:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 今天晚上\N我们就住这里好不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:42.45,0:33:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我赞成
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:43.65,0:33:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可以啦 我们说好了\N一定要回去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:46.79,0:33:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天早上再回去嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:49.79,0:33:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个 快点起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:57.50,0:33:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是饭店那边传来的声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:05.27,0:34:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪 到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:20.29,0:34:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是铁皮制的遥控飞机耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:22.72,0:34:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是那些人在操纵的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:27.66,0:34:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手\N胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:29.53,0:34:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手\N我们今天晚上会没地方住…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:36.97,0:34:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可恶\N我一定要好好的教训你们才行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:40.44,0:34:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:46.95,0:34:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈 救我…妈妈 天啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:50.32,0:34:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 快躲进草丛里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:52.15,0:34:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点\N快点 快点来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:58.19,0:35:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太可恶了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:03.86,0:35:05.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:05.73,0:35:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 你想要做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:14.44,0:35:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:15.78,0:35:17.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是胖虎厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:19.91,0:35:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趁现在赶快去找一些石头来\N快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:22.48,0:35:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:26.02,0:35:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是现在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:30.69,0:35:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,击中了\N成功了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:35.70,0:35:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 最大的一架逃走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:41.10,0:35:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们快点追过去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:42.44,0:35:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要弄清楚他们的真面目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:44.14,0:35:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我们走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:45.30,0:35:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好\N好 加油加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:49.31,0:35:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:50.54,0:35:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些少年不但勇气十足\N而且相当坚强
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:55.72,0:35:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个星球的人应该很值得信赖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:59.29,0:36:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等我啦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:02.49,0:36:04.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄怎么老是这个样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:04.89,0:36:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那架飞机都不知道\N飞到哪里去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:10.13,0:36:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的走不动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:11.96,0:36:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是哆啦A梦在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:13.83,0:36:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就可以给我们竹蜻蜓了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:16.14,0:36:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 我真是糊涂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:18.91,0:36:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看 我有带竹蜻蜓来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:21.67,0:36:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这个大笨蛋\N怎么不早点拿出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:33.05,0:36:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看 那个是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:41.76,0:36:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:45.30,0:36:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面好暗 看不清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:47.70,0:36:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像有什么声音耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:49.97,0:36:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:52.10,0:36:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这个星球的人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:53.84,0:36:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你们是外星人啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:56.81,0:36:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们竟然把我们的飞机击落了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:00.61,0:37:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 你们的狸被我们抓到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:04.15,0:37:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,狸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:06.22,0:37:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道他们说的是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:08.79,0:37:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你在里面吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:10.89,0:37:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:15.03,0:37:16.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:16.43,0:37:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:26.87,0:37:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:38.48,0:37:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:41.35,0:37:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,飞走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:43.09,0:37:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪了 他们到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:46.06,0:37:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些人怎么可以这么粗暴呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:49.00,0:37:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道 我什么事都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:53.03,0:37:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过有件事情很清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:56.60,0:37:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是哆啦A梦被抓走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:58.84,0:38:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的好朋友被抓走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:00.77,0:38:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我绝对不能够坐视不管
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:03.01,0:38:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在就去救他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:05.11,0:38:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:06.45,0:38:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 怎么救啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:08.38,0:38:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很简单啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:09.35,0:38:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以用以前用的\N宇宙救生艇去追啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:12.18,0:38:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,问题是那个道具\N不是在哆啦A梦的口袋里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:21.93,0:38:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:23.30,0:38:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是地震耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:25.03,0:38:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地面发出了好大的声响耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:27.07,0:38:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,待在这里很危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:28.23,0:38:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快找行李箱 先回去一趟吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:30.17,0:38:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:34.47,0:38:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海边是这个方向
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:40.18,0:38:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕 海往下沉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:42.32,0:38:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:47.65,0:38:50.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是 是岛飞起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:06.17,0:39:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快找出行李箱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:07.71,0:39:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:11.51,0:39:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我记得行李箱是放在这里的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:13.95,0:39:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海边的情形好像全都变了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:17.28,0:39:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了 在那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:20.45,0:39:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:25.69,0:39:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 是饭店里的那只兔子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:29.46,0:39:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:32.80,0:39:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被它吃掉了\N快吐出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:34.53,0:39:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把行李箱还给我们\N吐出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:37.14,0:39:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑掉了\N别跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:41.14,0:39:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:47.05,0:39:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 那边有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:48.28,0:39:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:52.18,0:39:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎你们 四位战士
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:55.25,0:39:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的名字叫做沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:59.16,0:40:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你叫我们战士
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:01.13,0:40:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:02.70,0:40:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了拯救加摩加星球上的人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:05.40,0:40:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们必须\N跟刚才那些叛军作战才行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:08.60,0:40:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,作战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:09.80,0:40:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我们跟那些玩具作战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:12.07,0:40:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,叛军 你们是不是搞错了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:15.24,0:40:19.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊\N我们几个只是小学生耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:19.51,0:40:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题 你们可以作战的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:22.68,0:40:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪有这么简单啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:24.98,0:40:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可没有办法保证喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:27.39,0:40:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要先回家跟我妈妈商量一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:29.69,0:40:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经没有时间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:31.26,0:40:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这座岛已经向加摩加星前进了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:41.43,0:40:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要 我要回去地球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:43.10,0:40:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把行李箱拿出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:45.30,0:40:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:47.04,0:40:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不要动粗啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:51.38,0:40:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧少爷 你没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:54.01,0:40:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就不要逞强\N快进活动舱去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:56.88,0:40:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 少爷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:07.76,0:41:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加摩加星的人不进活动舱的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:10.63,0:41:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就什么都不能做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:12.36,0:41:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的好羡慕你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:14.07,0:41:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能够自由自在的活动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:28.08,0:41:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是…\N你怎么会选上我们几个呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:31.78,0:41:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这个宇宙里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:33.39,0:41:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实有很多星球\N都有人类在居住的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:38.19,0:41:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:39.29,0:41:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,却没有可以\N成为我们伙伴的人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:43.90,0:41:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后终于发现了你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:46.73,0:41:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:48.17,0:41:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求求你们救救加摩加星球的人\N好不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:51.50,0:41:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你们务必要帮忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:54.84,0:41:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:58.24,0:42:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 那我们就试试看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:01.31,0:42:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 光凭我们四个人耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:03.62,0:42:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且我们现在\N也没有哆啦A梦的法宝啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:07.65,0:42:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:08.82,0:42:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了救哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:10.12,0:42:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们几个也只能这么做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:12.29,0:42:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 就这么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:13.79,0:42:15.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去救那个星球的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:18.16,0:42:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们\N太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:19.83,0:42:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:23.17,0:42:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位一定很累了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:24.67,0:42:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天晚上就好好的休息吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:30.34,0:42:32.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是不可思议\N我们已经在宇宙里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:33.05,0:42:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是重力跟空气\N都跟在地球上一模一样耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:36.35,0:42:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好诡异喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:37.18,0:42:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来说明一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:45.29,0:42:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好方便的活动舱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:47.53,0:42:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:48.63,0:42:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过我还是希望\N能靠自己的脚走路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:51.63,0:42:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请到这边来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:02.71,0:43:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请各位看一下楼上的密室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:20.73,0:43:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:22.23,0:43:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就是在这里操纵这个岛的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:24.40,0:43:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还制造人工重力跟空气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:26.87,0:43:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难怪 就算在宇宙里\N也都没有什么感觉耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:30.84,0:43:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个岛四周\N全都是用壁障围起来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:34.04,0:43:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是高超的科技
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:36.24,0:43:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些东西全部都是我爸爸做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:39.41,0:43:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你爸爸现在在哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:41.98,0:43:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸他…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:43.58,0:43:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 我们准备好欢迎晚宴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:46.52,0:43:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:55.23,0:43:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请各位尽量享受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:03.04,0:44:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:03.90,0:44:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了答谢你们\N我来唱一首歌献给你们大家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:09.78,0:44:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 土星看起来好大喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:12.88,0:44:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:14.45,0:44:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要仔细看个够\N我也要看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:16.28,0:44:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:17.42,0:44:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难得我想唱一首歌替大家助兴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:20.39,0:44:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们差不多要进入\N第一个宇宙弯曲地带了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:28.23,0:44:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有很多的房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:30.26,0:44:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位可以休息了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:32.43,0:44:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安啰 静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:33.57,0:44:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:35.13,0:44:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下次我非要唱到歌不可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:42.91,0:44:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦\N你一定要等我们去救你喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:03.20,0:45:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里…是什么地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:05.30,0:45:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这只臭狸 醒过来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:08.17,0:45:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:09.50,0:45:12.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在开始我要审问你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:12.57,0:45:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要再躲了 快给我出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:15.21,0:45:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:17.38,0:45:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你只要乖乖回答\N我的问题就行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:19.81,0:45:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁要理你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:25.55,0:45:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧跟那伙人在岛上做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:29.62,0:45:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我又不认识什么沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:31.46,0:45:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:34.79,0:45:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还不说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:36.23,0:45:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,饭店的地下明明有个大迷宫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:40.80,0:45:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点告诉我那个迷宫的秘密
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:43.64,0:45:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是真的什么都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:46.47,0:45:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的什么都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:52.11,0:45:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼 敬酒不吃吃罚酒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:57.05,0:45:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然如此…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:03.69,0:46:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把电压调到最高
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:20.64,0:46:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,电脑好像已经烧焦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:23.41,0:46:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来它已经没什么用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:26.48,0:46:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它当作废铁\N扔到大海里去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:29.58,0:46:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:39.09,0:46:42.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前加摩加星\N也是一个很棒的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:42.53,0:46:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加摩加人在大自然的环境中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:45.06,0:46:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孕育了高度的文明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:47.23,0:46:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加摩加人不喜欢战争
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:49.10,0:46:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个人像小孩子似的天真无邪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:51.77,0:46:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,个性也很开朗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:53.54,0:46:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喜欢玩 喜欢做快乐的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:55.71,0:46:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能过悠闲自在的生活\N是最大的梦想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:58.61,0:47:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种心情 我能够暸解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:01.65,0:47:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们真的能够体会 对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:05.02,0:47:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就因为如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:06.22,0:47:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的科技\N就一直朝这个方面发展
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:10.66,0:47:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们开发了\N各种劳动用的机器人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:13.93,0:47:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,农业 工业
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:15.83,0:47:19.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,乡镇公所 商店 医生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:19.43,0:47:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几乎所有的工作\N都交给机器人来做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:23.94,0:47:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外像警察 军队\N也都机械化了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:28.51,0:47:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后我们又陆陆续续\N开发了许多方便型的机器人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:33.11,0:47:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是后来我们逐渐厌倦了\N这种开发的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:36.85,0:47:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,于是就创造了发明家机器人\N纳波基斯特拉博士
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:41.45,0:47:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它的全身\N几乎都是由电脑组成的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:44.66,0:47:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,博士为了让人类\N过着更方便的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:47.16,0:47:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陆续发明了很多东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:49.16,0:47:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后 人类根本就不需再劳动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:52.30,0:47:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天都像星期天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:54.53,0:47:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天都是星期天啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:56.67,0:47:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗 羡慕死了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:58.74,0:48:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:00.61,0:48:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,博士最大的发明\N就是感应电脑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:05.18,0:48:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是说…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:06.88,0:48:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是一种能把人心里想的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:09.25,0:48:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直接传达给机器的一种系统
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:11.62,0:48:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:12.69,0:48:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类根本连一根手指都不必动\N就能享受一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:16.16,0:48:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这简直是天堂嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:17.52,0:48:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也好希望\N住在那个星球上面喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:20.96,0:48:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是这么想的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:22.19,0:48:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种生活\N我们百分之百愿意过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:24.46,0:48:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然你们认为那里是天堂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:26.97,0:48:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:28.20,0:48:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸很快就察觉到\N这是相当危险的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:31.97,0:48:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸卡里欧公爵\N他是个科学家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:37.51,0:48:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安拉肯国王
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:38.61,0:48:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你立刻下令\N中止使用感应电脑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:40.91,0:48:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公爵 怎么突然说这种话呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:43.18,0:48:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是人类的身体不用\N就会渐渐退化
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:45.79,0:48:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再也没有任何功能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:47.32,0:48:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再这么下去\N要是机器人没了的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:49.92,0:48:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也就动不了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:52.02,0:48:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这你不用担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:54.13,0:48:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 博士您来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:56.23,0:48:59.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种情况我已经有了新的对策
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:59.53,0:49:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是不是又发明了什么东西\N博士
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:02.74,0:49:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您请看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:04.27,0:49:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要进入这个活动舱\N就可以自由的活动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:09.91,0:49:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:11.31,0:49:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给全国的人民各做一台
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:13.38,0:49:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不妥当\N我们不能使用这种东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:16.05,0:49:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个东西会…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:18.55,0:49:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么了 振作一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:21.15,0:49:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没事 只是跑得太急了一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:23.76,0:49:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没事…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:25.46,0:49:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它马上就可以派上用场了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:30.46,0:49:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要 我不要用这种东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:32.87,0:49:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快放我出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:35.53,0:49:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放我出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:37.24,0:49:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个东西还真是方便啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:41.27,0:49:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经感觉到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:43.64,0:49:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要对他有警戒之心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:50.05,0:49:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过不了多久\N到处都可以看到活动舱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:01.16,0:50:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再这么下去的话\N人类一定会灭亡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:04.30,0:50:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一定要尽早\N完成我的研究才可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:07.37,0:50:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然这样 我也来帮忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:09.67,0:50:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:11.60,0:50:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸 什么事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:13.64,0:50:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们马上到别墅去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:16.44,0:50:18.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要去白金岛吗\N没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:18.78,0:50:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上准备出发吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:20.65,0:50:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:30.62,0:50:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈 这一次\N我一定要征服大迷宫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:35.39,0:50:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大迷宫\N就是地下室那个迷宫吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:38.20,0:50:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你进到里面去了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:40.43,0:50:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有 我本来要进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:42.47,0:50:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是太害怕 就没进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:44.34,0:50:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好你没有进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:46.01,0:50:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我家的祖先\N因为乐趣制造的大迷宫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:49.81,0:50:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全长有一百八十四公里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:53.88,0:50:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,向右 向左
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:55.38,0:50:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,往上 往下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:56.95,0:50:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到目前为止\N已经有数百个人向它挑战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:59.95,0:51:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是没有一个人过关
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:02.76,0:51:06.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有我爸爸知道\N怎么走到中央大厅的路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:07.79,0:51:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸于是在中央大厅\N设了一间研究室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:11.86,0:51:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大约有一年的时间\N我爸爸跟妈妈都在地下室生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:16.17,0:51:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最后终于完成了研究工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:18.54,0:51:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完成了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:20.14,0:51:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:21.44,0:51:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一定要赶快回去\N向国王报告这件事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:24.98,0:51:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:26.98,0:51:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸妈这趟出去可能会有危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:29.48,0:51:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你替爸爸守住研究室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:31.78,0:51:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要小心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:32.89,0:51:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一发生了什么状况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:34.52,0:51:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白金 这孩子就麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:36.99,0:51:38.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托你留守了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:38.82,0:51:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:42.39,0:51:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子 你要加油喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:44.43,0:51:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:46.83,0:51:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:48.70,0:51:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸 妈\N一路要小心喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:54.91,0:51:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我最后一次见到爸妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:01.98,0:52:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在几天之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:07.19,0:52:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全国的人民
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:09.42,0:52:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是加摩加星球的皇帝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:12.12,0:52:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纳波基斯特拉一世
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:15.26,0:52:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:16.26,0:52:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:18.73,0:52:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类的时代结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:21.20,0:52:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来是机器人的时代
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:25.40,0:52:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要取代没用的人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:28.44,0:52:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来统治这个世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:32.65,0:52:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说 是机器人造反了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:35.11,0:52:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么赶往皇宫的父母亲\N不就都…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:38.08,0:52:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概和其他人一样\N都被抓起来了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:42.55,0:52:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:45.29,0:52:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们已经穿越宇宙弯曲地带
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:47.03,0:52:48.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快到里面去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:58.24,0:53:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那里 那就是加摩加星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:00.74,0:53:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好漂亮喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:09.65,0:53:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 白金岛消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:12.45,0:53:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们去了一趟遥远的地球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:14.69,0:53:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样无功而返吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:18.32,0:53:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧跟他们的同伴\N知道我军要接近了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:22.53,0:53:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以很快地逃进宇宙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:25.90,0:53:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:27.97,0:53:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是逃进宇宙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:30.40,0:53:32.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:32.50,0:53:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们一定是回到这个星球来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:36.41,0:53:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能吗 他们敢这么做吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:38.58,0:53:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 现在有地球人在帮沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:41.98,0:53:43.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不能够大意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:43.68,0:53:46.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急加强海陆空的戒备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:00.47,0:54:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于平安登陆了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:02.80,0:54:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是北极海
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:04.44,0:54:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一年到头都浓雾笼罩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:06.44,0:54:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很少有人会靠近这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:08.34,0:54:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是现在躲在这里\N也没什么用啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:11.61,0:54:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看干脆就带着你爸爸的发明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:14.85,0:54:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一起冲进皇宫去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:17.05,0:54:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样就可以救出哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:19.08,0:54:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有你爸爸跟妈妈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:20.75,0:54:23.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是问题并没有这么简单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:23.22,0:54:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一 对于我爸爸的发明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:25.46,0:54:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我并不是知道的很清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:27.33,0:54:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第二 我不知道现在\N街头的情况如何
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:30.56,0:54:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不知道爸妈他们在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:34.50,0:54:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的想法你们听听看怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:36.90,0:54:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以先回去大迷宫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:39.04,0:54:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去看看你爸爸之前\N留下来的研究记录
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:42.24,0:54:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果它们利用这个时候\N攻过来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:44.44,0:54:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那怎么办啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:45.74,0:54:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想这倒不会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:47.61,0:54:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还是先收集情报好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:50.02,0:54:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就分成两组
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:51.65,0:54:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其中一组跟我到迷宫研究室去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:54.45,0:54:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外一组潜入市区探查情况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:58.12,0:55:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们觉得这样可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:01.36,0:55:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 这个任务就交给我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:03.80,0:55:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:04.96,0:55:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:06.63,0:55:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,废话 当然就是我跟你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:08.70,0:55:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还会有什么人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:10.04,0:55:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么可以自行决定呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:12.00,0:55:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还有一个好办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:14.11,0:55:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 把那个拿来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:16.28,0:55:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:19.21,0:55:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你们久等了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:23.75,0:55:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:25.62,0:55:28.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是组装好的机器人零件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:29.22,0:55:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们穿看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:31.39,0:55:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是要我们伪装成机器人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:34.19,0:55:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:36.13,0:55:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么那么丑啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:39.03,0:55:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得不错啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:40.97,0:55:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要穿上了这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:42.30,0:55:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就一定没有人\N会认得出来你是小夫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:45.10,0:55:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:47.07,0:55:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们马上出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:48.77,0:55:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,市区要怎么去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:51.01,0:55:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们准备好了潜水舰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:00.05,0:56:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都已经设定好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:01.82,0:56:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它可以直航\N靠近首都附近的无人海岸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:05.29,0:56:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们几个潜进去之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:07.23,0:56:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看情形就回来喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:09.36,0:56:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:11.10,0:56:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,千万不要引起不必要的麻烦喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:13.83,0:56:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道…看我们的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:16.84,0:56:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我有个万一的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:18.57,0:56:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请转告我妈妈一声 拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:21.37,0:56:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们要拿出精神来 加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:23.84,0:56:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:26.11,0:56:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:27.18,0:56:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油 小夫 胖虎\N快点回来喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:30.45,0:56:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:32.62,0:56:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要小心喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:43.70,0:56:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 我们几个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:45.30,0:56:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也应该尽快的\N向大迷宫的研究室出发了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:54.34,0:56:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 你在吃什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:56.64,0:56:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它在准备大家的粮食
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:58.81,0:57:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到研究室要花上一天的时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:02.25,0:57:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么老鼠啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:04.22,0:57:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个叫做引导鼠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:07.12,0:57:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它会引导我们\N走到爸爸的研究室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:11.39,0:57:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引导鼠 一切都拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:16.76,0:57:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你终于来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:18.43,0:57:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是通往另一个世界的\N大迷宫入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:22.40,0:57:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一进去里面就无法活着回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:25.40,0:57:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你有心理准备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:27.31,0:57:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就进去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:31.04,0:57:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出发了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:38.85,0:57:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下 大事不好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:42.25,0:57:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:46.19,0:57:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了 尼吉林将军
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:47.79,0:57:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我…的…发…条…\N好…像…松…了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:54.87,0:57:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也太散漫了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:00.24,0:58:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不是散漫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:01.97,0:58:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是年纪大了\N所以发条才容易松掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:05.28,0:58:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你搞懂了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:07.35,0:58:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:09.78,0:58:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有紧急状况
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:11.62,0:58:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:13.69,0:58:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么事情 这么慌张
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:16.32,0:58:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:18.32,0:58:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有一艘迷航的巡逻船
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:21.19,0:58:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在北极海徘徊的时候\N发现了白金岛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:25.96,0:58:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 是真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:28.07,0:58:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的确没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:29.90,0:58:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,立刻出动机动部队
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:37.34,0:58:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雾也散掉了 天空整个放晴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:40.35,0:58:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是手上有钓竿 那就更好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:42.81,0:58:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的心情还真是轻松耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:46.12,0:58:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:50.12,0:58:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想 那应该是候鸟群吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:55.76,0:58:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,船开始下沉了啦 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:01.27,0:59:03.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吓死我了啦 胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:03.34,0:59:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这虽然只是玩具\N但总还是艘潜水舰啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:07.74,0:59:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,问题是\N怎么突然之间就往下沉啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:10.68,0:59:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是说嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:11.84,0:59:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样真的是太乱来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:15.01,0:59:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎\N这样能顺利到达目的地吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:28.03,0:59:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起雾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:29.66,0:59:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就要进入北极海
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:32.93,0:59:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白金岛就在前面 全速前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:41.41,0:59:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 我一定会去救你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:45.38,0:59:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要等我喔 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:50.95,0:59:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:54.02,0:59:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 我在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:56.42,0:59:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:57.26,0:59:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 谢谢你来救我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:59.93,1:00:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还以为你讨厌我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:01.86,1:00:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以自己回去未来世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:04.03,1:00:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不会把你留下来\N一个人回去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:07.67,1:00:08.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:09.03,1:00:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是大雄 我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:11.27,1:00:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要说了啦 我们快走
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:14.17,1:00:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你的力气好大喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:16.27,1:00:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走吧\N谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:20.05,1:00:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:22.21,1:00:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我…的…身…体…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:25.22,1:00:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变成石头
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:26.32,1:00:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你撑着点啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:31.26,1:00:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你别走啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:33.63,1:00:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:36.63,1:00:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是一场梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:38.56,1:00:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是海底的垃圾场
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:41.43,1:00:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对喔 我的身体已经被破坏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:45.74,1:00:47.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真希望这辈子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:47.71,1:00:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还能够再见大雄最后一面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:58.28,1:01:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在潜到哪里了 小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:01.15,1:01:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎么会知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:02.65,1:01:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一直在海里\N什么都看不到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:04.96,1:01:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用潜望镜或许可以看见什么吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:08.26,1:01:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你去看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:09.56,1:01:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去看啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:11.30,1:01:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:12.30,1:01:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从刚才一直在吃东西\N都不工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:15.07,1:01:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为很无聊啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:20.41,1:01:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一定是大都市美加波利
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:22.91,1:01:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗 让我看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:25.98,1:01:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们已经接近目的地了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:48.53,1:01:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 我们走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:51.17,1:01:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 真的没问题吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:53.17,1:01:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用担心啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:12.12,1:02:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,研究室还没有到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:14.36,1:02:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只走了四分之一的路
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:18.46,1:02:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有很多休息室
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:20.37,1:02:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们几个就先休息一下好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:23.47,1:02:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 把吃的东西拿出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:29.71,1:02:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普的肚子里面\N有好多的东西喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:32.71,1:02:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普跟哆啦A梦好像喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:36.55,1:02:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们说的哆啦A梦\N是你们很重要的朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:40.35,1:02:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:41.95,1:02:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是没有任何人\N可以取代的朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:44.76,1:02:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是个机器人对不对
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:46.59,1:02:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然它是一个机器人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:48.23,1:02:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过它比人类更像个人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:50.53,1:02:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了哆啦A梦 我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:54.37,1:02:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:56.33,1:02:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道这是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:03.61,1:03:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:05.04,1:03:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把整个岛都给我轰掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:22.53,1:03:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还要潜到更深的地方去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:48.19,1:03:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧跟他的同伴
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:50.32,1:03:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个都别让他们逃跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:55.89,1:03:57.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,报告将军\N我们发现了一个洞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:58.10,1:03:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是迷宫的入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:10.48,1:04:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 快拿探照灯出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:13.71,1:04:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要紧吧 沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:15.65,1:04:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没事 谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:17.42,1:04:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚才的攻击好猛烈喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:20.25,1:04:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是停电了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:22.02,1:04:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,饭店可能已经遭到攻击了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:24.32,1:04:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连发电所的控制中心\N也被破坏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:27.36,1:04:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引导鼠坏掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:30.70,1:04:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 那接下来我们该怎么做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:32.93,1:04:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘘 安静
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:38.64,1:04:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们那些家伙一定躲在这里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:41.04,1:04:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个不留 全部给我抓出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:43.78,1:04:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我听到好多好多脚步声
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:46.34,1:04:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是机器人大军
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:48.15,1:04:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然离我们还有几公里远
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:50.28,1:04:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是它朝我们这边来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:52.25,1:04:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 我们再往里面走
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:15.77,1:05:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个人类都没有耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:17.78,1:05:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们一定全都被抓起来\N关到哪里去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:21.38,1:05:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们要怎么去找出\N他们被关的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:24.35,1:05:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:27.32,1:05:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去问看看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:29.22,1:05:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行啦 胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:32.06,1:05:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看吧 引起他的怀疑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:34.16,1:05:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:35.23,1:05:36.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:36.69,1:05:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么没见过你们这种机器人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:38.86,1:05:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住在哪儿 做什么工作的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:41.30,1:05:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个嘛…我们…这个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:43.84,1:05:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好了 快来人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:51.11,1:05:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:57.75,1:06:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想要打探点消息还真困难耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:00.72,1:06:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我才不想负责这个工作啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:05.59,1:06:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是餐厅耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:07.09,1:06:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 吃点东西吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:14.47,1:06:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎光临 请问要吃什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:17.60,1:06:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么好吃的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:20.34,1:06:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本店的招牌菜是\N由产地直送的天然铀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:25.21,1:06:28.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外还有贮藏了十亿年的\N纯生石油
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:28.78,1:06:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么都是这些东西\N有没有其他的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:31.75,1:06:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道你们的动力是上发条
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:34.65,1:06:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,转十次是一钱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:36.92,1:06:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是要充电
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:38.22,1:06:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是要换电池\N我们有最新式的太阳能电池
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:42.29,1:06:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不是要这些
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:44.30,1:06:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们有没有猪排饭\N或汉堡之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:47.10,1:06:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们怎么会要人类吃的食物呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:50.97,1:06:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新闻快报
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:52.90,1:06:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巡逻警察在附近的海岸\N发现了潜水舰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:56.84,1:06:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:58.41,1:07:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,潜水舰内疑似有人类的形迹
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:01.68,1:07:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许他们已经潜进了市区
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:03.75,1:07:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然有人类闯进来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:06.12,1:07:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是难以相信呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:15.06,1:07:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这样的 刚才…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:26.50,1:07:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这下糟糕了 怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:29.07,1:07:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:30.44,1:07:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看来只好等到天黑再出去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:51.30,1:07:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多可以走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:52.73,1:07:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 我肚子饿得走不动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:54.97,1:07:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有什么吃的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:56.47,1:07:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的食物\N全被你在潜水舰里面吃掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:59.47,1:08:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:01.41,1:08:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肚子好饿 有什么办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:05.11,1:08:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这什么味道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:06.74,1:08:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 干嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:08.18,1:08:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:10.18,1:08:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要光顾着走嘛\N你去哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:12.62,1:08:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一股香味\N从那个方向传过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:15.99,1:08:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:17.19,1:08:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是从那里传出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:38.58,1:08:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 都是食物耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:40.71,1:08:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们把做好的食物\N送到那个房间去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:43.65,1:08:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:51.46,1:08:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奇怪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:52.52,1:08:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么多的食物\N到底是做给什么人吃的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:55.73,1:08:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是做给人类吃的才对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:58.66,1:09:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:00.23,1:09:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,机器人根本就不吃这种食物
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:02.60,1:09:05.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以这种食物\N应该是送到有人类的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:05.87,1:09:07.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说没错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:07.74,1:09:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一点都没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:08.97,1:09:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要我们跟着这些食物走…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:11.48,1:09:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就可以知道他们被关在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:14.98,1:09:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们潜到底下\N已经有多久的时间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:18.68,1:09:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:19.48,1:09:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里根本看不到太阳跟月亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:22.12,1:09:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老实说 我也不敢确定\N我们前进的方向是不是正确的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:26.49,1:09:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会吧 那我们不是白费力气
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:30.19,1:09:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好累喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:32.13,1:09:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是休息的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:35.40,1:09:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:37.47,1:09:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是我们吃剩的便当盒吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:39.90,1:09:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是之前休息的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:41.47,1:09:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会这样呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:42.91,1:09:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来我们又绕回原来的地方了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:45.78,1:09:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,累死了 我走不动了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:49.08,1:09:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄\N我们怎么可以这样就气馁呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:52.08,1:09:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦怎么办呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:54.15,1:09:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:55.09,1:09:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦不在\N我们根本就没有办法冒险啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:58.42,1:10:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管结果会变成怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:00.36,1:10:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都不想再管了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:05.10,1:10:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起…\N都怪我把你们牵连进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:09.53,1:10:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别这么说 这又不是你的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:12.24,1:10:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊 打起精神来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:14.44,1:10:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,休息一下\N我们再另外找别的路
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:18.24,1:10:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕了 我又听到\N好多好多人的脚步声靠近了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:23.38,1:10:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天啊 那该怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:25.38,1:10:28.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有什么地方\N可以让我们躲起来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:30.62,1:10:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:32.39,1:10:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 快把那个行李箱拿出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:34.89,1:10:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:39.56,1:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个快点从这里出去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:44.40,1:10:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧 你们也来呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:46.47,1:10:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有义务\N要守护我爸爸研究的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:49.57,1:10:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 你们两个不一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:51.41,1:10:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行\N我们不能丢下你们自己回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:54.41,1:10:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 先回地球去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:56.41,1:10:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经没有时间了 达普
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:58.35,1:10:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:00.59,1:11:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 沙比欧…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:03.72,1:11:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:06.16,1:11:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我绝对不会忘记\N你们的友情的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:10.60,1:11:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然我不知道\N我能撑到什么时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:14.00,1:11:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过我会以身为人类这份骄傲\N全力以赴的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:20.81,1:11:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:22.37,1:11:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:24.18,1:11:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:09.65,1:12:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是给人类吃的\N先检查一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:13.06,1:12:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:14.49,1:12:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家每天都很辛苦的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:19.43,1:12:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把东西卸下来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:34.01,1:12:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天准备这么多东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:36.08,1:12:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂这些没用的人类吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:38.32,1:12:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太浪费了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:40.08,1:12:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是麻烦的要命
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:42.89,1:12:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过 听说最近\N就要把他们处理掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:46.96,1:12:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,处理掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:47.96,1:12:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这什么意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:52.70,1:12:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 快跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:54.33,1:12:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:00.20,1:13:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再跑的话 我就要开枪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:13.22,1:13:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 做得好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:15.05,1:13:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 我只开过碰碰车而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:17.56,1:13:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,换你来吧 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:20.22,1:13:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种卡车比碰碰车还要简单
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:36.81,1:13:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经好几天都没有回家了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:38.94,1:13:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定会被妈妈骂得很惨
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:55.23,1:13:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来该怎么做呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:58.10,1:14:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他该不会已经回来了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:05.04,1:14:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:09.11,1:14:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:11.78,1:14:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次我偷看这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:13.84,1:14:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦他一定会骂我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:16.05,1:14:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说我侵犯他的隐私
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:18.05,1:14:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实我什么都知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:20.12,1:14:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦的脚旁\N有个四次元的垃圾桶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:23.49,1:14:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在他的枕头下面…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:26.79,1:14:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,枕头下面…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:36.13,1:14:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:38.37,1:14:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我找到了…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:39.50,1:14:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 你小声一点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:41.57,1:14:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香 我找到一个法宝
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:43.51,1:14:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么法宝\N你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:45.71,1:14:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,内裤
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:47.71,1:14:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是啦 你看清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:49.71,1:14:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个是哆啦A梦的预备袋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:54.09,1:14:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你听我说…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:57.82,1:15:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗\N这个袋子里面的四次元空间
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:00.73,1:15:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟哆啦A梦身上的那个口袋\N是相连的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:03.66,1:15:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:04.60,1:15:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么说\N我们只要进到这个袋子里…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:06.90,1:15:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错\N这样我们就可以找到哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:10.03,1:15:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们现在就去找他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:18.81,1:15:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:20.24,1:15:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道哆啦A梦现在在水里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:23.25,1:15:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:24.75,1:15:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:26.42,1:15:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个法宝
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:28.85,1:15:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,适应灯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:30.99,1:15:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有了这个适应灯
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:32.42,1:15:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管是在海底还是外太空
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:34.36,1:15:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就可以适应啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:35.93,1:15:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不用说明了 快点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:37.93,1:15:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:41.77,1:15:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来就换我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:43.77,1:15:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:47.64,1:15:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:48.64,1:15:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我先进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:11.96,1:16:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 我一直在找你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:13.90,1:16:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还以为见不到你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:16.60,1:16:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:18.30,1:16:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎么了 你说话啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:20.97,1:16:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:22.47,1:16:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦看起来好像坏掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:25.18,1:16:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能不能想想办法呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:26.98,1:16:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:29.25,1:16:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 我记得应该有…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:33.05,1:16:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,迷你哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:34.75,1:16:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个迷你哆啦A梦\N应该可以把哆啦A梦给修好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:37.99,1:16:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用缩小灯把它缩小…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:43.13,1:16:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听好喔 你一定要修理好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:45.93,1:16:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:47.90,1:16:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好不容易才找到你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:49.33,1:16:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一定要撑下去喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:51.00,1:16:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 振作一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:55.51,1:16:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:56.51,1:16:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就开这架飞机\N回去白金岛好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:12.66,1:17:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 你会操纵吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:14.46,1:17:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我尽量试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:18.30,1:17:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:20.10,1:17:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 你办到了耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:28.87,1:17:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看不出来 你还挺行的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:31.31,1:17:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种小事啊 难不倒我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:02.51,1:18:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:04.07,1:18:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是奇怪\N我到底发生了什么事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:07.41,1:18:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 你看清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:09.21,1:18:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我 我是大雄啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:12.02,1:18:14.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄 是你啊\N太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:14.72,1:18:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香 你也来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:16.09,1:18:17.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到你好高兴喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:17.92,1:18:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你终于修复好了 太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:19.86,1:18:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个是来这里救我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:21.86,1:18:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:23.53,1:18:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 把你修好的\N是迷你哆啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:26.80,1:18:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:28.80,1:18:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:30.03,1:18:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在还不是高兴的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:31.94,1:18:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧他们有危险了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:33.80,1:18:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧他们…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:35.31,1:18:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这件事情说来话长啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:37.31,1:18:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 我们先离开这里\N马上去白金岛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:40.74,1:18:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我这里有很多的法宝
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:43.25,1:18:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对安全的救命木筏
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:46.88,1:18:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要坐这个去白金岛啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:48.89,1:18:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这要怎么用
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:50.19,1:18:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要把你的手放到瓶口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:56.63,1:18:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点把手放到瓶口啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:03.20,1:19:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 出发了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:13.14,1:19:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管海浪多强
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:14.58,1:19:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个瓶子会确实飘流到目的地
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:18.58,1:19:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦\N没有速度更快一点的道具吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:22.15,1:19:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就用这支木桨来划吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:26.86,1:19:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这也太麻烦了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:28.73,1:19:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了啦 不要埋怨了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:30.29,1:19:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要快点划就对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:32.60,1:19:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 是飞机耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:34.50,1:19:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许那是机器人的空军
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:36.43,1:19:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是我们被发现的话\N那该怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:44.07,1:19:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你放心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:45.44,1:19:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从外面看\N只不过是一只空瓶子而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:53.02,1:19:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫\N我们是朝白金岛的方向没有错吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:57.02,1:19:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:58.46,1:20:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直都是往北的方向飞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:00.52,1:20:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:02.09,1:20:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 有乌云飘过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:19.54,1:20:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算遇到了暴风雨
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:21.35,1:20:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,待在这个瓶子里也绝对安全
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:24.72,1:20:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N我们现在准备来吃东西吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:28.15,1:20:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的肚子好饿喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:29.92,1:20:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 看上面喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:33.49,1:20:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果要吃东西的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:34.86,1:20:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要稍微敲一下这棵树
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:38.43,1:20:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要我们啃椰子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:40.06,1:20:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:41.80,1:20:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个里面啊 有义大利肉酱面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:46.67,1:20:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个啊 是汉堡排\N附热腾腾的白饭
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:50.24,1:20:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然还有我最喜欢的铜锣烧啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:53.68,1:20:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:02.09,1:21:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很笨耶 你给我好好的开嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:06.09,1:21:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,风雨这么强\N根本就很难控制啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:09.03,1:21:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这又不是遥控飞机
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:36.79,1:21:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:37.79,1:21:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,利用暴风雨\N很快就到达白金岛了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:45.50,1:21:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纳波基斯特拉的军队\N好像已经撤走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:53.00,1:21:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里已经全毁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:54.71,1:21:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连饭店的影子也没了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:56.64,1:21:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个叫沙比欧的宇宙人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:58.74,1:22:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想他应该还被困在\N地下的迷宫里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:01.58,1:22:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们快去找他
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:03.58,1:22:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道可不可以\N顺利找到沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:05.95,1:22:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能很困难吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:07.25,1:22:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为只有引导鼠跟卡里欧公爵\N知道迷宫的正确路线
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:11.26,1:22:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,既然是这样的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:12.52,1:22:14.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有一个好东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:14.66,1:22:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,迷宫探测球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:17.90,1:22:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:30.41,1:22:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个迷宫探测球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:31.98,1:22:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它现在在仔细的调查每个角落
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:36.28,1:22:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 已经调查完毕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:38.78,1:22:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么一来这个机器\N就能够把这个迷宫的地图
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:42.12,1:22:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部都输入记忆体里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:43.79,1:22:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我们先去找沙比欧吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:46.42,1:22:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:48.86,1:22:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在先去\N宇宙少年沙比欧的位置
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:53.36,1:22:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出发了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:10.45,1:23:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 那是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:11.95,1:23:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点停
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:14.82,1:23:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些是要抓沙比欧的士兵
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:17.65,1:23:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:19.66,1:23:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们拼命的找\N连发条都松掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:23.03,1:23:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 有的士兵才会放弃吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:25.90,1:23:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样看来\N沙比欧可能没有再往里头走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:29.40,1:23:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,探测球 出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:37.67,1:23:39.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧少爷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:39.74,1:23:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有引导鼠\N根本就没有办法动弹
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:43.61,1:23:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真恨我自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:45.48,1:23:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竟然没有体力了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:47.18,1:23:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又有东西靠近了 沙比欧少爷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:49.69,1:23:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又是士兵的脚步声吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:52.42,1:23:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是螺旋桨的声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:57.83,1:23:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什么东西呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:00.70,1:24:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧 是我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:03.63,1:24:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是大雄他们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:05.70,1:24:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没事 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:07.87,1:24:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是在做梦吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:09.21,1:24:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们是怎么进来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:10.71,1:24:12.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用哆啦A梦的道具啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:12.58,1:24:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 我叫沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:14.38,1:24:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请多多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:16.08,1:24:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:17.85,1:24:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也请你多多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:19.52,1:24:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的事情\N大雄都已经跟我说过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:22.79,1:24:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们大家\N应该可以走到中央大厅才对
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:47.74,1:24:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里到底是什么地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:50.41,1:24:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们一直往北方走
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:52.12,1:24:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没想到真的来到北极了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:56.75,1:24:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的很笨耶 小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:59.06,1:25:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这有什么办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:00.42,1:25:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能够到达这里也是个创举嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:02.69,1:25:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,骂我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:03.63,1:25:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里这么冷 肚子也饿扁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:05.76,1:25:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一步都走不动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:07.70,1:25:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不要那么任性了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:09.33,1:25:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种地方不可能会有餐厅的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:15.77,1:25:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是房子耶 得救了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:17.71,1:25:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走\N等一下啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:19.08,1:25:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种地方怎么可能会住人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:21.71,1:25:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 那里有灯光啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:23.58,1:25:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里不是住着人 会是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:27.02,1:25:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想 那一定是机器人的基地
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:30.59,1:25:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 再这么下去的话…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:36.59,1:25:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是北极熊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:58.38,1:25:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:59.88,1:26:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:00.88,1:26:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里感觉\N不太像是机器人的基地
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:03.62,1:26:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:05.62,1:26:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,管它是机器人还是什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:07.49,1:26:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我快冻死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:09.06,1:26:12.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好冷喔 快想想办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:12.70,1:26:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还是去看看好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:17.00,1:26:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 你看那个…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:19.84,1:26:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那里面的\N是不是机器驯鹿啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:23.47,1:26:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是北极 应该会有吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:25.98,1:26:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是满怪的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:28.51,1:26:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起…请问有人在家吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:32.52,1:26:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是谁啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:34.15,1:26:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是迷路的善良地球少年
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:37.02,1:26:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你帮帮我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:38.59,1:26:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们肚子好饿 又快冻死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:40.86,1:26:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请救救我们吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:43.43,1:26:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉 我的任务已经完成了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:47.16,1:26:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就让我安静的休息吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:49.43,1:26:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要这么说嘛…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:50.60,1:26:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托 让我们进去一下好不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:59.11,1:27:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:02.11,1:27:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个 快点进来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:11.82,1:27:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这里吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:13.26,1:27:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错 这是中央大厅的入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:16.26,1:27:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的指纹就是钥匙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:24.13,1:27:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是不可思议耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:25.64,1:27:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这个地下迷宫内\N竟然还有这样的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:30.97,1:27:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爸爸说的大金库就是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:33.58,1:27:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸研究的东西\N一定就在这里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:36.91,1:27:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该知道怎么开吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:39.65,1:27:41.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已经问过白金了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:51.09,1:27:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:53.60,1:27:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这到底是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:59.74,1:28:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧 你终于来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:02.44,1:28:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:03.57,1:28:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有预感纳波基斯特拉会叛变
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:06.44,1:28:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了这一天\N我留下了应变对策
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:09.01,1:28:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是让机器人的电脑\N失控的程式
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:11.75,1:28:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且它还具有传染性
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:14.52,1:28:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,机器人感染之后数小时\N就会发生作用
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:18.19,1:28:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎么都听不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:19.62,1:28:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说的是什么意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:21.32,1:28:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这也就是所谓的电脑病毒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:23.83,1:28:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,简单的说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:24.83,1:28:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是一种可以让机器人\N得到传染病的种子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:28.40,1:28:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要让所有的叛乱机器人\N感染病毒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:31.33,1:28:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就必须要把这个程式\N输入纳波基斯特拉的身体里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:34.64,1:28:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的意思是说\N只要在首脑的身上输入病毒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:38.21,1:28:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么其他的机器人\N也就会跟着中毒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:41.34,1:28:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有了这个 就万无一失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:43.21,1:28:46.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我们现在\N马上去美加波利城散播吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:51.65,1:28:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:53.16,1:28:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你该不会又要我们坐木筏去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:56.36,1:28:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很遗憾
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:57.43,1:29:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前我们的交通工具\N也只有这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:05.07,1:29:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,达普 你去看一看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:06.44,1:29:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:10.07,1:29:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧少爷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:11.51,1:29:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又有东西接近这个岛了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:15.45,1:29:17.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会又是机器人的空军
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:17.51,1:29:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:19.75,1:29:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是一种很特殊的声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:36.67,1:29:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,穿穴环
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:48.21,1:29:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞老公公
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:52.28,1:29:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加摩加星球也有圣诞老公公啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:55.35,1:29:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地球也有吗\N是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:57.79,1:30:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么圣诞老公公现在会出现
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:03.56,1:30:07.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 我替你们送礼物来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:07.43,1:30:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 我们回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:10.43,1:30:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是胖虎 还有小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:13.87,1:30:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎 小夫\N哆啦A梦 你平安无事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:16.01,1:30:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:17.37,1:30:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们两个\N怎么会找到圣诞老公公的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:20.88,1:30:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来世界上还有这么多的孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:25.82,1:30:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来 乖孩子们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:27.38,1:30:29.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是送给你们的玩具
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:29.39,1:30:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部都送给你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:31.75,1:30:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:32.76,1:30:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是现在并不是圣诞节耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:35.96,1:30:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且也不是玩玩具的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:38.96,1:30:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 也许我们用得着喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:41.83,1:30:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要用放大灯放大\N稍微改造一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:44.17,1:30:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样就可以用了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:45.77,1:30:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:47.34,1:30:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞节到的时候\N我还会再来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:50.67,1:30:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家要保重了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:54.41,1:31:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞老公公 再见\N再见了 谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:03.35,1:31:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 我们就不要再耽搁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:05.29,1:31:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快去救大家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:11.13,1:31:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧他们绝不可能\N在大迷宫里存活下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:14.80,1:31:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,驾飞机逃亡那两个人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:16.93,1:31:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也在那一场暴风雨中消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:19.57,1:31:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以皇帝殿下 请您放心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:22.44,1:31:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切都没问题的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:24.14,1:31:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:25.37,1:31:28.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们根本就不知道\N人类有多厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:28.88,1:31:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们一定还会回来复仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:31.01,1:31:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全面加强戒备
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:32.88,1:31:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个头这么大 胆子还满小的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:36.79,1:31:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:38.22,1:31:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么 我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:40.16,1:31:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会加强戒备的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:51.80,1:31:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,北北东疑似潜水舰\N正在接近当中
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:55.04,1:31:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,距离1500
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:59.18,1:32:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接近500
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:01.18,1:32:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,200
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:05.11,1:32:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蠢蛋 那是鲸鱼
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:07.55,1:32:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类收容所就在这附近
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:10.92,1:32:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确实是这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:12.12,1:32:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们逃走时 有过一座大桥
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:14.49,1:32:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王宫在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:15.76,1:32:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里的警备相当森严\N恐怕很难靠近
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:19.13,1:32:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,圣诞老公公送我们的礼物
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:21.20,1:32:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在又可以派上用场了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:23.27,1:32:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的非常谢谢你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:24.87,1:32:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了加摩加星球\N你们这么尽力的帮我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:28.27,1:32:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别这么说 我们只不过…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:30.37,1:32:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是站在正义的一方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:33.08,1:32:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:05.68,1:33:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从来就没有玩过\N这么大的遥控玩具
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:13.25,1:33:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:14.32,1:33:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为有填充玩具一起加入作战
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:16.69,1:33:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警备的防卫能力就减弱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:18.62,1:33:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快把纳波基斯特拉找出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:24.06,1:33:25.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在那里 下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:27.70,1:33:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是谁
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:28.56,1:33:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是地球的机器人\N我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:31.77,1:33:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是地球人大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:33.64,1:33:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来就是你们跟着沙比欧\N一起来违抗我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:37.27,1:33:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,士兵们 快来呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:38.51,1:33:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这个糟老头\N机器人都被我们制伏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:41.28,1:33:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟老头…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:42.85,1:33:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快叫我皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:45.08,1:33:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皇帝殿下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:46.35,1:33:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我这个麻烦人物\N来跟你谈一谈吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:52.46,1:33:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:54.22,1:33:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸 妈妈\N沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:56.29,1:33:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是在做梦吧 孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:58.53,1:34:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是梦 我真的是沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:00.93,1:34:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在没有时间解释了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:03.03,1:34:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他的人都关在什么地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:05.60,1:34:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,国王就在隔壁房间里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:07.87,1:34:10.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他地方还有好几千个市民\N都在那儿
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:11.04,1:34:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管说什么\N你都不愿意跟人类和平共存
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:14.11,1:34:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:15.04,1:34:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少废话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:16.75,1:34:19.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要把人类全部都毁灭掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:19.55,1:34:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样就没什么好谈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:21.55,1:34:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们想怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:39.97,1:34:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:41.27,1:34:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:42.27,1:34:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在就只要等程式生效了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:45.84,1:34:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:49.91,1:34:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全军听令 别理会那些玩具
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:53.15,1:34:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上集中火力炮击收容所
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:56.15,1:34:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把人类彻底消灭
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:02.79,1:35:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,动作快
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:03.79,1:35:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家快点逃出去 快点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:05.93,1:35:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:07.03,1:35:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部都脱险了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:08.73,1:35:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:09.53,1:35:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们也赶快逃吧 沙比欧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:17.61,1:35:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 一个人也没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:20.94,1:35:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 咚咚咚
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:22.61,1:35:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在说什么蠢话啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:24.68,1:35:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊咚摩基摩基
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:32.32,1:35:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊咚摩基摩基
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:44.33,1:35:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊咚摩基摩基
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:49.91,1:35:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胖虎\N看来我们的战略已经成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:52.78,1:35:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于可以喘一口气了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:55.64,1:35:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊咚摩基摩基
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:58.41,1:36:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊咚摩基摩…
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:19.17,1:36:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们现在失去了所有的一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:22.17,1:36:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全都完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:23.51,1:36:25.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们并没有失去一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:25.37,1:36:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切才要开始呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:28.18,1:36:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人类本来就是住山洞里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:30.51,1:36:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,使用石器\N一步步的把文明建立起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:34.32,1:36:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们一切重新来过
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:36.25,1:36:40.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我们重新建造一个\N更适合人类充满活力的社会
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:41.52,1:36:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要是我们可以帮得上忙的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:43.53,1:36:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请不用客气 尽管告诉我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:45.53,1:36:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:46.70,1:36:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会靠自己的双手努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:48.40,1:36:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先要锻炼好自己的身体
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:50.40,1:36:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:51.33,1:36:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以后我也不再依赖\N哆啦A梦给我的道具了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:54.84,1:36:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:56.64,1:36:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的做得到吗 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:59.54,1:37:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我当然做得到啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:01.41,1:37:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我看很难
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:02.48,1:37:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:03.65,1:37:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄终于也有所领悟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:06.48,1:37:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:33.01,1:37:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,考试完了之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:41.32,1:37:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抬起头仰望蓝天
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:48.82,1:37:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我最不拿手的吊单杠
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:57.33,1:38:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于在风中完成了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:05.54,1:38:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夹在书本里的压花
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:12.62,1:38:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每片花瓣都是我的回忆
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:21.92,1:38:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,FEELING GOOD
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:27.36,1:38:34.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美好的回忆串连起的项链
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:34.37,1:38:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不曾给别人看过我的宝石
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:41.58,1:38:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天凝视一颗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:47.65,1:38:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是属于我的幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:52.82,1:38:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,FEELING GOOD
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:11.84,1:39:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美好的回忆串连起的项链
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:18.78,1:39:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不曾给别人看过我的宝石
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:25.79,1:39:30.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每天凝视一颗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:32.13,1:39:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是属于我的幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:37.20,1:39:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,FEELING GOOD

